{"id":"05cd07926be1f869","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-satisfaction-class.md","title":"Satisfaction Class","display":"df-satisfaction-class — Satisfaction Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-satisfaction-class","aliases":["58-df-satisfaction-class"],"display":"df-satisfaction-class — Satisfaction Class","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-satisfaction-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-satisfaction-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction-class — Satisfaction Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb489a34bc2433c\" href=\"?note=1cb489a34bc2433c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,S,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,S,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（带显式项求值函数的组合满足关系谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb489a34bc2433c\" href=\"?note=1cb489a34bc2433c\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SatClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SatClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的满足类谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatClass}_S(S,\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\n(S,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatClass}_S(S,\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\n(S,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>上游四元谓词已经用等式/关系原子、否定、析取和全称量词的 Tarski 子句刻画满足关系，并同时绑定唯一的项求值函数；这里仅作三元投影。</li>\n<li>旧稿混用了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> 与公式定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\)</span>，并把五元项值关系误写成未定义的函数项；复用规范上游可消除这两处签名漂移。</li>\n<li>这里定义的是集合结构上、标准良构公式代码域中的 set-coded 满足关系；非标准算术模型的 full satisfaction class 需要另立内部代码定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4$（带显式项求值函数的组合满足关系谓词，见 [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\mathfrak A,S,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SatClass}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatClass}_S(S,\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\n(S,\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A},\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},a_{\\mathrm{rel}}","display":false}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-satisfaction-class.md|58-df-satisfaction-class]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["1cb489a34bc2433c"]}